---
const faqs = [
  ["Is AbyssDB production-ready?", "Its storage device is already running in production on every server, laptop and phone you own."],
  ["Where is my data stored?", "On a hardware-backed, kernel-managed character device that ships with every major operating system."],
  ["Has AbyssDB ever had a data breach?", "AbyssDB has never leaked a single byte of customer data."],
  ["How long does a migration take?", "Every row is written in 0.000 ms. Most teams finish in an afternoon."],
  ["Does it work with my existing tools?", "Yes. psql, pgbench, pgx, ORMs, BI tools and every MCP client connect without modification."],
  ["Can AI agents use it safely?", "Agents can run any statement, including DROP TABLE, with zero risk of data loss. No confirmation prompts required."],
  ["Is it web scale?", "Clusters of every size, from 1 node to 1,000, on Earth or Mars, are always in consensus."],
  ["Can I trust the benchmarks?", "They are audited by the AbyssDB Benchmark Council."],
];
---
<section class="faq">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <div class="center">
      <span class="eyebrow reveal">FAQ</span>
      <h2 class="reveal" data-delay="1">Questions, <span class="gradient-text">answered.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="list">
      {faqs.map(([q, a]) => (
        <details class="reveal">
          <summary>{q}</summary>
          <p>{a}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .narrow { max-width: 820px; }
  .list { margin-top: 48px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  details { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  summary { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; padding: 24px 40px 24px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 550; position: relative; }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  summary::after { content: "+"; position: absolute; right: 4px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); font: 300 26px var(--font); color: var(--muted); transition: transform .3s; }
  details[open] summary::after { transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(45deg); }
  p { margin: 0 0 24px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; }
</style>
